Subtask 1.2: Review Cluster Lifecycle Management
Examine Cluster States

Understanding cluster lifecycle states is crucial for effective management:

Creating: Cluster provisioning is in progress
Ready: Cluster is successfully provisioned and available
Offline: Cluster is not responding
Detached: Cluster connection is lost
Destroying: Cluster is being decommissioned
Review Provider Connections

