Task 2: Creating Automation Templates
Subtask 2.1: Create Infrastructure Provider Connection
Navigate to Provider Connections

In the RHACM console, go to Infrastructure > Provider connections.

Add New Provider Connection

Click Add connection and select your cloud provider. For this lab, we'll use AWS as an example.

Configure AWS Provider Connection

# Example AWS provider connection configuration
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
  name: aws-provider-connection
  namespace: open-cluster-management
  labels:
    cluster.open-cluster-management.io/type: aws
    cluster.open-cluster-management.io/credentials: ""
type: Opaque
data:
  aws_access_key_id: <base64-encoded-access-key>
  aws_secret_access_key: <base64-encoded-secret-key>
  baseDomain: <base64-encoded-base-domain>
  pullSecret: <base64-encoded-pull-secret>
  ssh-privatekey: <base64-encoded-ssh-private-key>
  ssh-publickey: <base64-encoded-ssh-public-key>
Apply Provider Connection

Save the configuration and verify the connection status.

Subtask 2.2: Create Cluster Template
Navigate to Cluster Creation

Go to Infrastructure > Clusters and click Create cluster.

Select Infrastructure Provider

Choose Amazon Web Services from the available providers.

Configure Cluster Template

Create a comprehensive cluster template with the following specifications:

# cluster-template.yaml
apiVersion: hive.openshift.io/v1
kind: ClusterDeployment
metadata:
  name: managed-cluster-01
  namespace: managed-cluster-01
  labels:
    cloud: AWS
    region: us-east-1
    vendor: OpenShift
spec:
  baseDomain: example.com
  clusterName: managed-cluster-01
  controlPlaneConfig:
    servingCertificates: {}
  installed: false
  platform:
    aws:
      credentialsSecretRef:
        name: aws-provider-connection
      region: us-east-1
  provisioning:
    installConfigSecretRef:
      name: managed-cluster-01-install-config
    sshPrivateKeySecretRef:
      name: managed-cluster-01-ssh-private-key
    imageSetRef:
      name: img4.12.0-x86-64-appsub
  pullSecretRef:
    name: managed-cluster-01-pull-secret
