Task 3: Provisioning New OpenShift Clusters
Subtask 3.1: Deploy Cluster Using Template
Create Cluster Namespace

# Create namespace for the new cluster
oc create namespace managed-cluster-01
Apply Cluster Configuration

# Apply the cluster deployment configuration
oc apply -f cluster-template.yaml

# Apply the install configuration
oc apply -f install-config.yaml
Create Additional Required Secrets

# Create SSH key secret
oc create secret generic managed-cluster-01-ssh-private-key \
  --from-file=ssh-privatekey=/path/to/ssh-key \
  -n managed-cluster-01

# Create pull secret
oc create secret generic managed-cluster-01-pull-secret \
  --from-file=.dockerconfigjson=/path/to/pull-secret.json \
  --type=kubernetes.io/dockerconfigjson \
  -n managed-cluster-01
Subtask 3.2: Monitor Cluster Creation Progress
Check Cluster Deployment Status

# Monitor cluster deployment
oc get clusterdeployment managed-cluster-01 -n managed-cluster-01 -w

# Check detailed status
oc describe clusterdeployment managed-cluster-01 -n managed-cluster-01
Monitor Installation Logs

# View installation logs
oc logs -f deployment/hive-controllers -n hive

# Check cluster provision status
oc get clusterprovision -n managed-cluster-01
Track Progress in RHACM Console

Navigate to Infrastructure > Clusters
Locate your cluster managed-cluster-01
Monitor the status changes from Creating to Ready
Subtask 3.3: Configure Cluster Import
Create ManagedCluster Resource

# managed-cluster.yaml
apiVersion: cluster.open-cluster-management.io/v1
kind: ManagedCluster
metadata:
  name: managed-cluster-01
  labels:
    cloud: Amazon
    region: us-east-1
    name: managed-cluster-01
    cluster.open-cluster-management.io/clusterset: default
spec:
  hubAcceptsClient: true
Apply ManagedCluster Configuration

# Apply managed cluster configuration
oc apply -f managed-cluster.yaml
Create Klusterlet Addon Config

# klusterlet-addon-config.yaml
apiVersion: agent.open-cluster-management.io/v1
kind: KlusterletAddonConfig
metadata:
  name: managed-cluster-01
  namespace: managed-cluster-01
spec:
  clusterName: managed-cluster-01
  clusterNamespace: managed-cluster-01
  clusterLabels:
    cloud: Amazon
    vendor: OpenShift
  applicationManager:
    enabled: true
  policyController:
    enabled: true
  searchCollector:
    enabled: true
  certPolicyController:
    enabled: true
  iamPolicyController:
    enabled: true
Task 4: Validating Cluster Creation Process
Subtask 4.1: Verify Cluster Connectivity
Check Cluster Status

