Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Cluster Creation Stuck in Creating State
Symptoms: Cluster remains in "Creating" state for extended period

Resolution Steps:

# Check cluster provision logs
oc get clusterprovision -n managed-cluster-01
oc logs <clusterprovision-pod> -n managed-cluster-01

# Verify provider credentials
oc get secret aws-provider-connection -n open-cluster-management -o yaml

# Check install config
oc get secret managed-cluster-01-install-config -n managed-cluster-01 -o yaml
Issue 2: Managed Cluster Not Joining Hub
Symptoms: Cluster created but not appearing as managed cluster

Resolution Steps:

# Check managed cluster status
oc get managedcluster managed-cluster-01

# Verify klusterlet installation
oc --kubeconfig=/path/to/managed-cluster-kubeconfig get pods -n open-cluster-management-agent

# Check import secret
oc get secret managed-cluster-01-import -n managed-cluster-01
Issue 3: Authentication Failures
Symptoms: Unable to access managed cluster

Resolution Steps:

# Regenerate cluster credentials
oc get secret managed-cluster-01-admin-kubeconfig -n managed-cluster-01 -o yaml

# Verify cluster API endpoint
oc get clusterdeployment managed-cluster-01 -n managed-cluster-01 -o jsonpath='{.status.apiURL}'

# Test network connectivity
curl -k <cluster-api-url>/healthz
